<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,296.64 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,296.64 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at a sixth successive closing high of 7,296.64 points, up 55.55 points or 0.77 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 8.197 billion forints, up from 5.952 billion on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
